 picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://www.digitalsdaddy.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://www.digitalsdaddy.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102569640194207274813/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Rama Shankar N</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1739854656">04:57 18 Feb 25</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll" ><span class="wp-google-text">I had a fantastic experience with Digitals Daddy for my website development project. Their team was highly professional, delivering a sleek, responsive, and SEO-friendly website that exceeded my expectations.<br />The communication was smooth, and they met all deadlines efficiently.</span></div></div><svg height="16" width="16" role="none"><use href="#grw-google"/></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd grw-round"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="grw-img" src="https://www.digitalsdaddy.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ChIJM2da8Uv7DDkRQXb7xfPmUK8_2ab3cca7b96179265b5105af23213a05.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Aarna profile picture" width="50" height="50" onerror="if(this.src!='https://www.digitalsdaddy.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://www.digitalsdaddy.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" ></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108864380917441069711/reviews" class="wp-google-name" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Aarna</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-time="1693496712">15:45 31 Aug 23</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" s